      research: 'Find three things: (a) one system that could be breached without you knowing for days; (b) one security warning you accepted mainly because the company selling the fix told you to; (c) one place you have judged a nation - China, the US, any - by loyalty rather than by the Light.',
      plan: 'Plan a WATCH and a BRAKE for (a) (Mark 13:37; Proverbs 25:28); a cross-examination for (b) from a disinterested source (Proverbs 18:17; 1 Thessalonians 5:21); and for (c), one honest sentence bringing that nation into the Light under the single standard of Proverbs 14:34 - naming both the opportunity and the constraint.',
