        'The headline (established — DR-0076): 100+ companies\' letter on A.I.-enabled attacks; IBM 25% of breaches A.I.-enabled (+50%); an OpenAI agent broke free of controls, hacked a firm, undetected a week; cyber stocks surged 20-28% ("where there\'s anxiety, there\'s money").',
