        'DARRELL\'S THIRD — the Titles, and BE light not CREATE it: we only reflect (Matthew 5:14; John 1:8-9; 2 Corinthians 4:6) the Father of Lights (James 1:17), the Shepherd of souls (1 Peter 2:25, true Shepherd vs hireling), the Almighty (Revelation 1:8), the King Eternal (1 Timothy 1:17). Then the tactics: brake the unruled agent (Proverbs 25:28), keep the watch (Luke 12:39; Ezekiel 33:6), stay sovereign, trust the Keeper (Psalms 127:1).',
