      howToRun: 'Prayer + the anchor (5): read 1 Peter 5:8 and John 8:12 aloud (KJV). | Recap last week (10): the doom that did not come. | Teach the arc (15): watch (1 Peter 5:8; Mark 13:37) -> the headline + surging security stocks -> weigh the messenger who profits (Proverbs 18:17; John 10:12-13; Acts 19:25,27) -> the threat is real, both tiers (Proverbs 22:3; DR-0100) -> bring the nations into the Light (John 8:12; Ephesians 5:13; Proverbs 14:34; Acts 10:34-35; Daniel 2:21) -> the Titles, reflect not create (Matthew 5:14; John 1:8-9; James 1:17; 1 Peter 2:25; Revelation 1:8; 1 Timothy 1:17) -> count cost + sharpen (Luke 14:28; Ecclesiastes 10:10) -> build AND guard (Nehemiah 4:9,17) -> the unruled thing is a city without walls (Proverbs 25:28) -> the watchman who slept (Luke 12:39; Ezekiel 33:6) -> keep the heart (Proverbs 4:23). | Hands-on in the app (25): each names one blind-spot system (watch + brake), one warning to verify from a disinterested source, and one nation (their own included) to hold to the Light. | Discussion (15): the prompts below. | Send-off (5): the R->P->E — one watch, one brake, one verified threat, one nation in the Light, prayed over (Psalms 127:1).',
